OL,3,ANoel Fielding 'appalled' by jokes he
OL,4,Amade with Russell Brand
OL,5,
OL,6,FNoel Fielding has said he is "appalled"
OL,7,Fby jokes he made alongside Russell
OL,8,FBrand when the pair appeared together
OL,9,Fon TV and at live shows.
OL,11,FThe Great British Bake Off presenter
OL,12,Fsaid in a statement to the Sun he was
OL,13,F"horrified and deeply disturbed" to
OL,14,Flearn of Brand's crimes, after the
OL,15,Fdisgraced comedian was jailed for rape
OL,16,Fand sexual assault.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
