OL,3,ANoel Fielding 'appalled' by jokes he
OL,4,Amade with Russell Brand
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootage of Fielding and Brand joking
OL,7,Fabout rape with TV presenter Jonathan
OL,8,FRoss on an episode of Channel 4's Big
OL,9,FFat Quiz of the Year in 2007 has
OL,10,Fresurfaced in the aftermath of Brand's
OL,11,Fconviction.
OL,13,FFielding described "some of the jokes"
OL,14,Fhe made as "horrible and
OL,15,Finappropriate", and said he had not
OL,16,Fbeen in contact with Brand "for many
OL,17,Fyears".
